<title>USA: Sequoia UHSD, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Sequoia UHSD, Calif., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $18 million of Sequoia UHSD, Calif., general obligation bonds, election of 1996 Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.60 percent.</p>
</text>
